==Format==
* '''Qualification'''
**A total of 40 teams, who haven't qualified for the [[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2027/Championship|ALGS 2027 Championship]], will play in the '''Last Chance Qualifiers'''. 
*** {{Abbr/TBD}} teams from the [[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2026/Split_2/Pro_League/APAC South|Split 2 Pro league]].
*** 4 teams will secure direct qualification by winning the [[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2026/Split_2/Challenger_Circuits/APAC South|Split 2 Individual Challenger Circuit]] tournaments.
*** 6 teams minimum will qualify through the [[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2026/Split_2/Challenger_Circuits/APAC South|Split 2 Challenger Circuits Overall standings]].

* '''Brackt Stage'''
{{#section:Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2026/Championship/Last_Chance_Qualifier/APAC South/Bracket|Format}}
* See ''[[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2026/Championship/Last_Chance_Qualifier/APAC South/Bracket|Bracket Stage]]'' tab for Group Layout, Standings, and Match Sesults.

* '''Finals'''
** The 20 remaining teams will compete in the {{Abbr/MatchPoint/50}}
* See ''[[Apex_Legends_Global_Series/2026/Championship/Last_Chance_Qualifier/APAC South/Finals|Finals]]'' tab for Match Results

